public/sitemap.xml

# PRIVATE — never commit. Names an unannounced rebrand; this repo is public.
# Removed from tracking 2026-08-20 (Sana). Kept out by pattern rather than by
# memory, because the whole failure mode is somebody re-adding it without
# thinking about which repo they are in.
BRAND-CONTEXT.md
